WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.127
Zann crouched unseen behind the large plant as Morb and the trolls walked toward the machine.

2
00:00:06.128 --> 00:00:09.725
Morb stopped in front of the enormous contraption and studied it.

3
00:00:09.726 --> 00:00:12.910
He had a strange and frightening look on his face.

4
00:00:12.911 --> 00:00:16.549
He barely noticed when Slib came scurrying into the courtyard.

5
00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:26.189
"Thank you for saving me from that terrifying creature, Your Majesty," said Slib. "And for lifting the Dousing spell."

6
00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:31.447
"I almost didn't bother to save you," he told Slib, still looking at the machine.

7
00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:34.455
"You really aren't worth the energy it took.

8
00:00:34.456 --> 00:00:38.450
But I wanted you to witness my moment of triumph."

9
00:00:38.451 --> 00:00:44.157
"It will be my honor, Your Majesty," said Slib, simpering.

10
00:00:44.158 --> 00:00:47.780
Zann crouched lower, taking care to stay hidden.

11
00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:51.554
He wished he knew how to do that Guiding spell that Fala had used.

12
00:00:51.555 --> 00:00:55.521
Boz and all those other powerful Reds were right inside.

13
00:00:55.522 --> 00:01:00.969
They could stop Morb. If only Zann could somehow let them know that Morb was back!

14
00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:05.488
But it was too risky. If Zann made a move, Morb would hear him.

15
00:01:05.489 --> 00:01:09.422
The trolls would hear him. Zann decided to stay put and wait.

16
00:01:09.423 --> 00:01:14.382
He watched as Morb held up a hand. Dangling from it was something small.

17
00:01:14.383 --> 00:01:18.520
Zann squinted and saw that it was a leech.

18
00:01:18.521 --> 00:01:25.165
"Do you see this, you incompetent fool?" Morb said, thrusting the wriggling gray creature toward Slib.

19
00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:31.401
"This was all I needed to complete my machine and put the final step of my plan into action."

20
00:01:31.402 --> 00:01:36.105
"B-but how, Your Majesty?" Slib stammered.

21
00:01:36.106 --> 00:01:40.356
"I thought you needed the blue leeches to make the machine work.

22
00:01:40.357 --> 00:01:46.913
It would take thousands of ordinary Magica leeches to equal just a handful of the blue ones!"

23
00:01:46.914 --> 00:01:52.474
Morb sneered. "If it's thousands I need, then it's thousands I'll have."

24
00:01:52.475 --> 00:01:54.739
He tossed the leech onto the ground.

25
00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.107
Then he rubbed his hands together, causing sparks to fly.

26
00:01:58.108 --> 00:02:03.289
There was a flash of energy, and another identical leech appeared beside the first.

27
00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:07.618
Slib stared in awe. "How is that possible?"

28
00:02:07.619 --> 00:02:13.374
Zann was awed too. Morb had just used a Duplication spell on the leech.

29
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:18.432
"I didn't know that spell could work on a living creature!" Zann thought.

30
00:02:18.433 --> 00:02:22.391
He watched as Morb used the spell again and again.

31
00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:28.063
Soon there were dozens of leeches writhing on the ground—and then hundreds.

32
00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:31.925
Zann glanced at Morb, wondering when he was going to stop.

33
00:02:31.926 --> 00:02:39.305
Morb was red-faced and breathless. It was obvious that the Duplication spell was using up a lot of his energy.

34
00:02:39.306 --> 00:02:42.811
Finally Morb lowered his hand and stepped back.

35
00:02:42.812 --> 00:02:46.338
"Put them in the machine," he ordered the trolls.

36
00:02:46.339 --> 00:02:53.291
The trolls scooped up handfuls of leeches and started shoving them into a hole directly beneath the jawbone.

37
00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:57.749
"Careful!" Morb said as a troll's hand bumped the machine.

38
00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:01.868
"That's a one-of-a-kind relic, you clumsy fool!"

39
00:03:01.869 --> 00:03:06.692
Regardless of the danger to himself, Zann knew he had to do something.

40
00:03:06.693 --> 00:03:09.636
He stood up and quickly created some friction.

41
00:03:09.637 --> 00:03:17.345
"Boz! Morb is in the courtyard!" he shouted, using a Swelling spell to make his voice carry into the ballroom.

42
00:03:17.346 --> 00:03:21.604
Morb spun around. His eyes widened when he saw Zann.

43
00:03:21.605 --> 00:03:25.078
"You again!" he snarled.

44
00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:28.335
Morb sent a Blast spell flying at Zann.

45
00:03:28.336 --> 00:03:32.909
Zann barely managed to dodge it, and it demolished a stone bench instead.

46
00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:39.905
Zann gulped. Morb might have been weakened by the Duplication spell, but he was still incredibly strong.

47
00:03:39.906 --> 00:03:43.534
"Protect!" Zann blurted out, rubbing his hands together.

48
00:03:43.535 --> 00:03:48.000
A glowing purple bubble appeared, surrounding him on all sides.

49
00:03:48.001 --> 00:03:54.837
"Nice try, boy," Morb said sarcastically, rubbing his fingers together until sparks flew.

50
00:03:54.838 --> 00:03:59.588
"But your pathetic Shield spell is no match for my power!"

51
00:03:59.589 --> 00:04:04.231
Zann gulped, amazed at the energy sparking out of Morb's hands.

52
00:04:04.232 --> 00:04:09.664
Morb was right. Zann's Shield spell could never stop one of Morb's blasts.

53
00:04:09.665 --> 00:04:11.868
And it was too late to run.

54
00:04:11.869 --> 00:04:14.970
But Zann wasn't going to let Morb see him cower.

55
00:04:14.971 --> 00:04:21.992
Squaring his shoulders, he stared at the ball of energy hurtling toward him, waiting for the Blast spell to blow him apart.

56
00:04:21.993 --> 00:04:28.711
Just as Morb's blast was about to reach him, Zann saw his Shield spell change colors and expand.

57
00:04:28.712 --> 00:04:34.679
His eyes widened as the Blast spell bounced off it, shattering part of a nearby fountain.

58
00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:37.937
"What just happened?" wondered Zann.

59
00:04:37.938 --> 00:04:40.492
"Zann!" Boz shouted.

60
00:04:40.493 --> 00:04:46.726
Turning his head, Zann saw that his grandfather was running into the courtyard, along with a few other Reds.

61
00:04:46.727 --> 00:04:51.958
Boz had seen what was happening just in time to add his power to Zann's shield.

62
00:04:51.959 --> 00:04:55.100
Morb raised his hand. "Freeze!"

63
00:04:55.101 --> 00:04:58.927
Boz and the other Reds were instantly frozen in place.

64
00:04:58.928 --> 00:05:03.143
Without Boz's magic, Zann's shield lost its power.

65
00:05:03.144 --> 00:05:05.641
Morb turned back to Zann and smiled.

66
00:05:05.642 --> 00:05:11.672
"Now, if I remember correctly, I was about to blast you into oblivion."

67
00:05:11.673 --> 00:05:17.192
But before Zann could react, he heard a long, wheezing groan—it was the machine.

68
00:05:17.193 --> 00:05:20.713
The trolls were forcing the last of the leeches into the hole.

69
00:05:20.714 --> 00:05:25.502
Now the pythons in the glass tube were writhing furiously.

70
00:05:25.503 --> 00:05:27.731
"Uh-oh," Zann muttered.

71
00:05:27.732 --> 00:05:36.085
Morb lifted his arms in triumph. "Yes! Now Magica will witness my true power!"

72
00:05:36.086 --> 00:05:43.166
A thick, dark circle of smoke rose from the jawbone and slowly spread out in every direction.

73
00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:47.727
A troll standing next to the machine blinked as the smoke enveloped its body.

74
00:05:47.728 --> 00:05:52.042
Within seconds the troll slumped to the ground with a grunt.

75
00:05:52.043 --> 00:05:57.199
Zann could see the magical energy leave its body and flow into the spongelike creature.

76
00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:04.416
From there the energy appeared to mix with the water and then drip down into a glass tank beneath.

77
00:06:04.417 --> 00:06:08.896
Morb eyed the tank and smiled. "It's working!

78
00:06:08.897 --> 00:06:24.146
The ancient texts were right! Soon I will control every last bit of magic in Magica, and everyone will be forced to bow before me!"

